explicitly in the `risk_register`. Aim for 300–500 words.
{% elif detail_level == "detailed" %}
Break each phase into 4–8 concrete tasks. After each phase add an
`Assumptions` sub-block. The `risk_register` should have at least 5 entries.
Aim for 700–1000 words.
{% endif %}

